   "title": "Downloads + requirements",
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Downloads + requirements\n\nClick the file name to download it. Put each file in the folder shown (inside `ComfyUI/models/`).\n\n| Folder | File (click = download) | Size |\n|---|---|---|\n| `diffusion_models/` | [longcat_image_edit_turbo_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/LongCat-Image/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/longcat_image_edit_turbo_bf16.safetensors) | 12.54 GB |\n| `text_encoders/` | [qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Hunyuan-Video-1.5/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors) | 9.38 GB |\n| `vae/` | [ae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Z-Image-Turbo/resolve/main/split_files/vae/ae.safetensors) | 0.34 GB |\n\nAbout 22.3 GB together. The text encoder and VAE are shared by both LongCat files in this folder.\n\n**VRAM:** 12 GB is the target, not verified on a 12 GB card. Started with a 10 GiB budget (`--reserve-vram 13.89` on 24 GB) the whole card peaked at 11.2 GiB, same pictures, 28 s.\n\n**Run on ComfyUI 0.45.3.** **No custom nodes.**\n\nLicence: Apache-2.0 (LongCat-Image, meituan-longcat).\n"
   ]
  }
